{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏は浴衣～\n既に3回浴衣きた♡、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、\nゆっちゃん・かりん・ひなで\n大阪・京都の旅してきた٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪はUSJ！！\n京都は名所めぐり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"USJは去年ゆうりと誕生日にいって、\n人生二度目もゆうりと（笑）\n今回は、ゆうりのbirthday☆、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都は\nずっと行きたかった竹林と伏見稲荷。\nそして、浴衣来て京都を歩きたいという夢も実現させてくれた2人に感謝～.｡ﾟ+.(･∀･)ﾟ+.ﾟ\nみんなで慎重に浴衣選び。3人の色味を変えてバランスよくなるようにとかも考えつつ...写真ばえするデザインを選んだよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは、ショッキングピンク"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分らしい浴衣と帯、帯飾り〇\nポイントは、帯にレースいれたとこ〇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥居が大好きなので\n千本鳥居に興奮"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ可愛い浴衣で\n写真とれてよかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"USJは、\nずっと乗りたかった\nハリーポッターのやつと\nフライングダイナソーに乗れて感動"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてハリドリが最高に楽しい！！！興奮"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔ジェットコースター苦手やったのに\n今は得意٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿وスリル楽しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカイダイビング\nやってみたい٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日7/25(月)発売\n週刊プレイボーイ×TOKYO IDOL FESTIVAL 2016 公式BOOK『ナツ☆イチッ!~この夏、輝くアイドル全員集合~』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://tif-natsuichi.shueisha.co.jp/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に川後と中田が\nTIF注目アイドルについて等を話させていただきました！！！ぜひTIF興味ある方・行く方絶対見てね☆☆、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～ランダム返し～\n陽菜ちゃんのみっくちゅじゅーちゅ\nはいつ聞かせてくれますか？？？笑\n→えへへ～あはは～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(既読スルー)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週刊少年ジャンプ系の漫画読みますか？→漫画は最近はあんまり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小説ばっか読んでる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画ではないけど、ドラゴンボールとワンピースは毎週アニメで見てるよ！あと東京喰種は漫画もってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pは推しではないんですよ、でも\n最近気になってきて推し増ししそうです\n→わーいもっと気になってしまえ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京のライブまでにハート型ペンラ、ゲットしときます\n→きゃ～嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対探す～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、ハートのペンライト買おうか迷ってて、ハートのペンライトでも赤のほうがいい？\n→ううん！特に決めてないよ！基本赤にして、歌に合わせて色変えてる人が多いかも♡♡本数は、1本でも2本でもなんでもいいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんが好きな女の子\nのタイプをひたすら語っていただきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→永遠に語れる、本当に好きな女の子多いからなあ、、、、、、(；＿；)♡世に可愛い子多すぎて生きづれえ！けど生きる意味になる！ありがとう！って感じ。。。悲なみちゃんが永遠のミューズ☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃん、オフの日はなにして過ごすのー？インドア派ぽーい。\n→引きこもって映画みるか映画館いくか、美容dayにして整体・マッサージ・美容室など一気にいっちゃうか〇 基本1人で過ごすかな。誰かに誘われれば遊ぶけど、自分から誰かに連絡とかはしない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/26/6270569/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち☆、"}],"source":"archive"}